From 107aaad947bb9ccb84e40648cbad415bd45da779 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:51:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 01/11] dt-bindings: media: apple,avd: Add T6050

The M5 Pro/Max decoder is the T8142 generation (ADT avd-version 4) and
falls back to apple,t8142-avd. The J775D (M5 Ultra) device tree already
uses this pair.

Signed-off-by: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: LLM Claude
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,avd.yaml | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,avd.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,avd.yaml
index 1187255b0f47..0dd798f1be15 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,avd.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,avd.yaml
@@ -27,6 +27,9 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - const: apple,t6041-avd
           - const: apple,t8132-avd
+      - items:
+          - const: apple,t6050-avd
+          - const: apple,t8142-avd
       - enum:
           - apple,t8103-avd
           - apple,t6000-avd
